<p>Founded in 2007, Brain Seal is an independent video game developer and publisher based in the United Kingdom.</p>
<p>
  From dungeon-crawling adventures and gladiatorial battles to defending kingdoms and blowing things up, we've spent nearly two
  decades bringing our ideas to life. Since the release of our first game, Dark Quest, in 2013, our games have reached players
  across Steam, PlayStation, Xbox and Nintendo Switch.
</p>
<p>
  We don't believe in following trends or sticking to one formula. We believe in creative freedom, bold ideas, memorable worlds
  and, above all, great gameplay. Every game is a new adventure, built with the same independent spirit that started it all.
</p>
